      "seed": 1809226521,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793491821380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Two-stage rescore, like MMR: shard level = Nearest(candidates_limit), collection level = DimsFocus(limit).\n• Explanations are computed only on the node answering the client; never forwarded to peers.\n• Runs on the search runtime under the request timeout; CPU accounted as points × dims.\n• Terms are recomputed from stored f32 vectors: with quantization, Σ terms may differ slightly from \"score\".",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 79,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Two-stage rescore, like MMR: shard level = Nearest(candidates_limit), collection level = DimsFocus(limit).\n• Explanations are computed only on the node answering the client; never forwarded to peers.\n• Runs on the search runtime under the request timeout; CPU accounted as points × dims.\n• Terms are recomputed from stored f32 vectors: with quantization, Σ terms may differ slightly from \"score\".",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
